From 15a3676fbd1c72c1fed5ae5ff8d44881065ee5aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:20:20 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] web: flare page redesign from the reviewed mockup (D-103)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dark band with source and cursor time; state card + 131 Å disk + 4
channels; two-lane timeline with transport and, in archive, a whole-period
strip; period summary; one list of flares and alerts. Location as
Stonyhurst lat/lon plus arcsec.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
